[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF position, then disconnect the negative battery terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A1H</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584925\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584928\">5530B52</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Loosen the band and disconnect the the turbocharger air inlet\nsleeve from the rigid pipe, air flow  meter side.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065824.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Loosen the bands and remove the oil vapour recovery pipe between\nthe rigid pipe and turbo inlet sleeve.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065825.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Refit in its seating the oil vapour recovery\npipe between the rigid pipe and turbo inlet hose and tighten the\nbands.</p><p>Connect the air intake sleeve to the turbocharger,\nair flow meter side, and tighten the band.</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584928\">5530B52</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584925\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A1H</span></p></td></tr></table></div>"]]